  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Rain Check 4: weekly weather-reschedule summary\nEvery Monday it emails you how many jobs were rescheduled for weather in the last 7 days, how many confirmed, who asked for a call and who has not replied. Sends nothing in a dry week.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create a Google Sheet with a tab named Schedule using the header row in sheet-templates/Schedule.csv; paste its ID into the Config node (sheetId).\n2. In Config set your business name, owner email, channel (sms or email), the weekdays you work (workDays) and, only if you use workflow 3, your weather location and key.\n3. Attach credentials on nodes with a warning icon: Google Sheets OAuth2, SMTP, and Twilio (HTTP Basic Auth) if you use SMS.\n4. Dates are YYYY-MM-DD (format the day / new_day columns as plain text). Run with test rows (your own phone or email) before activating.",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 420
   },
